s journey across the United States that will change her forever. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-paced Exciting and Strategy-based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Second life is not the only thing given to the girl, but also a mysterious and frightening power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/18ca9140a9b33f3e859f701d6e5613ff.poster.avif?t=1755072027\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/18ca9140a9b33f3e859f701d6e5613ff.webm?t=1755072027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/18ca9140a9b33f3e859f701d6e5613ff.mp4?t=1755072027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SAS features a free-flowing and brutal combat style. Players will fight against hordes of zombies and monsters, moving, attacking, and dodging in countless fast-paced combat situations. Get ready to dive into the ocean of ketchup! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/8be5ffb83081abfb9b42dd2efaf9af21.poster.avif?t=1755072027\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/8be5ffb83081abfb9b42dd2efaf9af21.webm?t=1755072027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/8be5ffb83081abfb9b42dd2efaf9af21.mp4?t=1755072027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee weapons, ranged weapons, and some... strange weapons. Players are encouraged to choose all kinds of distinguishing weapons that satisfy their combat style and use different attack moves and abilities to fight their way out among different types of zombies, monsters, and bosses. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Living and become stronger&quot; in &quot;A Journey of 80s Pop Culture&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's more than just combat in Chouko's long journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/94b5a541289901570b8e4a4499880275.poster.avif?t=1755072027\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/94b5a541289901570b8e4a4499880275.webm?t=1755072027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/94b5a541289901570b8e4a4499880275.mp4?t=1755072027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SAS will take the player back to the 80s, a golden era filled with good old memories, to experience the unique scenery of post-apocalyptic &quot;Showa America&quot;, while exploring stories of people and survivors of different backgrounds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/5dda039717f81b1cbba92abb46006f36.poster.avif?t=1755072027\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/5dda039717f81b1cbba92abb46006f36.webm?t=1755072027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/extras/5dda039717f81b1cbba92abb46006f36.mp4?t=1755072027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a big RV as Chouko's new home, players will be able to customize and upgrade it, as well as enhance Chouko's status and unlock abilities through various enjoyable &quot;Living Activities&quot; gameplay with all kinds of resources found during exploration and combat, such as new weapons, costumes, collectibles, EXPs, and last but not least, unexpected nostalgic mini-games. Live a better life and become stronger, even if it is the end of the world!</p>","developers":["NEKCOM Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687540/ce4d0d62bcc4d558977f34685bb52e65f788a3f0/header.jpg?t=1755072027","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1687540/780829/a01266ab7b2f4753cc99a563a29d3df9e765dc70/1751019704/dash_av1.mpd?t=1730620920","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1687540/780829/a01266ab7b2f4753cc99a563a29d3df9e765dc70/1751019704/dash_h264.mpd?t=1730620920","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1687540/780829/a01266ab7b2f4753cc99a563a29d3df9e765dc70/1751019704/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1730620920","id":257070586,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070586/movie480.mp4?t=1730620920","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070586/movie_max.mp4?t=1730620920"},"name":"PV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257070586/84fc1d9094d01856b27e2dee967ff371e48a1767/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1730620920","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070586/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1730620920","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257070586/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1730620920"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1687540/42967